Description: [ChannelN],beats_to_bar: where the next bar of a deck is
 Read only, kept up to date by Auto DJ while it runs (from the play position
 updates of each deck): the beats from the play position to the next bar
 (downbeat), 0 < value <= 4, or 0 when the track has no beat grid. Bars are
 counted in 4 beats from the first phrase of the track structure (rekordbox
 or detected, patches 0007/0020), else its first downbeat, else the first
 beat. A script that starts a transition by itself (FADE NOW, a loop roll,
 a brake) waits for the next bar of the playing track, so that the bars of
 both tracks line up (the incoming track is cued on a phrase start by
 [AutoDJ],phrase_align). Beats are counted incrementally per deck.
Author: DecksmithOS
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-24
